# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
# Used by development/testing pipelines (LLM-as-judge, simulated users), NOT by the product itself.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# 签发课题用的私钥（Ed25519；配对的公钥编译在 packages/feature-research 里）。
# 未来由发课题的机构持有；现在只在这台开发机上，需要开发者自行备份 —— 丢了就再也签不出
# 能被已发布版本接受的课题。只在签发时用得上；产品本身从不读它，用户也永远不需要。
#
# Ed25519 private key that signs research tasks. In the future it belongs to the institution
# issuing the task; today it exists only on this development machine and the developer must
# back it up themselves. Needed only when issuing a task; the product never reads it, and
# users never need one.
RESEARCH_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=
